Package: tinydev
Title: A Tiny R Package Development Toolkit
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Mauricio", "Vargas Sepulveda", , "m.vargas.sepulveda@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1017-7574"))
Description: A minimalistic R package development toolkit that provides
    essential functions for creating R packages with ease. 'tinydev' is to
    'devtools' what 'tinytest' is to 'testthat', a lightweight alternative
    that focuses on simplicity and ease of use.
